                    "巨星引进计划有变", "Change to the superstar signing plan", "尊敬的球探：董事会本周改变了主意——他们决定直接收购一家已经有巨星的俱乐部，这样更快。原委托即刻撤销。为表歉意，随信附赠俱乐部定制咖啡杯一个，镀金的。", "Dear Scout, the board has changed its mind this week — they've decided to simply buy a club that already has a superstar. It's quicker. The original request is withdrawn with immediate effect. By way of apology, please find enclosed an official club coffee mug. Gold-plated.",
                    Slot("slot.w8.gulf.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 80, 55, 65)),
                Demand("demand.w9.availability", "club.industrial.union",
                    "铆钉联", "Rivet United", "上赛季联赛第 11 名，本赛季医务室使用率高居联盟第一。", "11th in the league last season; this season we top the league for treatment-room usage.",
                    "历史最佳：杯赛四强；那年的纪念围巾现在还挂在车间休息室里。", "Best ever: cup semi-finalists; the commemorative scarf still hangs in the factory break room.", "由工厂工会持股，预算与加班费挂钩。队医拥有俱乐部最高决策权——他刚刚宣布绷带库存告急。", "Owned by the factory union; the budget is pegged to overtime pay. The club doctor holds the ultimate decision-making power — and he's just declared the bandage reserves critically low.",
                    "拜托，帮我找个能一直上场的人", "Please, find me someone who can actually keep playing",
                    "球队已经伤了 7 名球员。老板现在完全不想听球员能力，只问一个问题：\n\n“他容易受伤吗？”\n\n如果答案是否定的，其他事情都可以再谈。", "We've already lost 7 players to injury. The boss doesn't want to hear about ability any more — he only asks one question:\n\n\"Is he injury-prone?\"\n\nIf the answer is no, everything else is negotiable.",
                    9, 2, 1500,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "伤员回归，委托取消", "The wounded return — request cancelled", "好消息：理疗室昨晚一下走出了四个人，阵容突然够用了。老板决定再观察观察。委托先撤，感谢您跑这一趟——顺便问下，您那里有二手拐杖吗？我们想囤几副备用。", "Good news: four players walked out of the physio room last night, so the squad suddenly looks big enough. The boss wants to wait and see. Request withdrawn — thanks for your trouble. By the way, do you happen to have any second-hand crutches? We'd like to stockpile a few, just in case.",
                    Slot("slot.w9.availability.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 55, 90, 70)),
                Demand("demand.w10.japan", "club.bayside.lightning",
                    "湾岸闪电", "Bayside Lightning FC", "上赛季联赛第 6 名，全队跑动距离第一、射门次数倒数第一。", "6th in the league last season: first for distance run, dead last for shots taken.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 4 名；庆祝方式是全体加跑十公里，此后再没人敢进前四。", "Best ever: 4th in the league; celebrated with a mandatory 10k run for the whole squad. Nobody has dared finish top four since.", "老板的哲学：技术是玄学，跑动是科学。训练基地墙上只有一行字——90 分钟后还在跑的人，才是我们的人。", "The owner's philosophy: technique is superstition, running is science. One line on the training-ground wall: if he's still running after 90 minutes, he's one of ours.",
                    "我们要跑死对面", "We plan to run the opposition into the ground",
                    "老板完全不关心进球数。只要求球员拥有离谱的体能和跑动能力。\n\n希望前锋通过跑动使日本所有的对手胆寒。\n\n“如果他90分钟以后还能跑，那就是我们的球员。”", "The boss doesn't care about goals at all. Only superhuman stamina and running power.\n\nThe forward should terrify every opponent in Japan with sheer running.\n\n\"If he can still run after 90 minutes, he's our player.\"",
                    10, 2, 1800,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "跑动型前锋招募中止", "Running-forward recruitment halted", "抱歉通知您：老板在马拉松赛道上直接签下了三个人——他们跑了 42 公里还能笑，就是我们要的人。原委托取消。感谢您的时间，也欢迎您下赛季来看我们跑……不，比赛。", "Sorry to inform you: the boss signed three players straight off a marathon course — they'd run 42 km and were still smiling, which makes them exactly our kind. The original request is cancelled. Thanks for your time, and do come watch us run next season — sorry, play.",
                    Slot("slot.w10.japan.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 60, 90, 65)),
                Demand("demand.w10.orange", "club.rotterdam.orange",
                    "橙港竞技", "Rotterdam Orange FC", "上赛季联赛第 5 名，控球率稳居前三，禁区内触球次数保密。", "5th in the league last season; possession stats comfortably top three. Touches in the opposition box: classified.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛亚军；最近一次发生在俱乐部仍用传真机的年代，那台传真机至今留作纪念。", "Best ever: league runners-up — back in the era when the club still used the fax machine. The fax machine is kept to this day as a memento.", "主教练是光头，战术手册厚达四百页，其中三百页讲门将如何用脚。俱乐部把“门将是第一进攻发起者”印在每一条围巾上。", "The manager is bald, his tactical manual runs to four hundred pages, and three hundred of them cover how goalkeepers should use their feet. The club prints \"the goalkeeper is the first playmaker\" on every scarf.",
                    "荷兰光头教练寻找门将的委托", "A bald Dutch coach's request for a goalkeeper",
                    "我们需要的不是一个只会站在门线上的门将。现代足球要求门将参与比赛，他必须能够帮助球队控制比赛节奏，在后场成为我们的第一名进攻组织者。", "We don't need a keeper who just stands on his line. Modern football demands a keeper who plays — he must help us control the tempo and act as our first playmaker from the back.",
                    10, 2, 2400,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "门将招募暂缓执行", "Goalkeeper recruitment suspended", "经教练组研究决定：现有门将的传球成功率已经可以原谅他的扑救。另外青训营发现一个会踢任意球的小孩，先内部提拔。委托撤回。本函已由传真机确认收到，请放心。", "Following deliberation, the coaching staff have decided the current goalkeeper's pass completion fully excuses his shot-stopping. The academy has also unearthed a kid who can take free-kicks, so we'll promote internally. Request withdrawn. This letter has been receipt-confirmed by the fax machine, so rest assured.",
                    Slot("slot.w10.orange.goalkeeper", PlayerPosition.Goalkeeper, 80, 70, 75)),
                Demand("demand.w11.valley", "club.valley.town",
                    "谷城", "Valley Town FC", "上赛季地区联赛第 2 名，升级附加赛最后一分钟被角球绝杀，全镇默哀三天。", "2nd in the regional league last season; lost the promotion play-off to a last-minute corner. The whole town observed three days of mourning.",
                    "历史最佳：全国业余杯十六强；那场的球票根至今是镇议会的抵押物。", "Best ever: last 16 of the national amateur cup; the ticket stubs from that match are still held by the town council as collateral.", "全队预算不如职业队一名替补的周薪，但全镇 4000 名居民都是股东。酒吧、面包房和邮局都在等“职业球队”这块招牌。", "The entire squad budget wouldn't cover one pro club substitute's weekly wage — but all 4,000 townsfolk are shareholders. The pub, the bakery and the post office are all waiting for the words \"professional club\" on the sign.",
                    "冲击职业联赛", "Chasing the professional leagues",
                    "希望能够拥有一名有过顶级联赛经验的球员帮助我们冲击职业联赛，这座小镇需要一只职业球队。", "We'd like a player with top-flight experience to help us push for the professional league. This little town needs a professional club.",
                    11, 4, 2000,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "冲职业计划调整通知", "Push-for-pro plan: adjustment notice", "球探先生，抱歉。镇议会投票决定，今年预算优先修镇口那座桥——桥塌了比降级更丢人。引援委托暂缓，等桥修好再谈。也欢迎您来谷城做客，桥修好后路会好走很多。", "Dear Scout, our apologies. The town council has voted to prioritise repairing the bridge at the town entrance with this year's budget — a collapsed bridge is more embarrassing than relegation. The recruitment request is on hold until the bridge is fixed. You're welcome in Valley Town any time; the road in will be much smoother once it's done.",
                    Slot("slot.w11.valley.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 75, 65, 70)),
                Demand("demand.w11.office", "club.attachment.tech",
                    "附件科技", "Attachment Tech FC", "上赛季企业联赛 B 组第 4 名，其中三场胜利来自对手加班弃权。", "4th in Corporate League Group B last season — three of those wins came from opponents forfeiting due to overtime.",
                    "历史最佳：企业杯亚军；决赛输球后，CEO 把对方公司的供应商合同全砍了。", "Best ever: Corporate Cup runners-up; after losing the final, the CEO cancelled all of the other company's supplier contracts.", "预算视季度财报浮动，训练安排在午休。现任门将的眼睛会在对方射门瞬间自动闭合，HR 认为这属于工伤。", "Budget fluctuates with the quarterly report; training happens at lunch. The current keeper's eyes close automatically at the moment of a shot — HR classes it as a workplace injury.",
                    "急需一个靠谱门将", "A reliable goalkeeper, urgently",
                    "你好，我们现在的门将每次对方射门都闭眼。\n\n下周和隔壁公司的比赛很重要。所以想找一个至少不会躲球的门将。扑不扑得到可以之后再说。", "Hello — our current goalkeeper closes his eyes every time the opposition shoots.\n\nNext week's match against the company next door is a big one. We're after a keeper who at least won't duck the ball. Whether he saves it can wait.",
                    11, 1, 300,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "门将招聘需求已关闭", "Goalkeeper vacancy closed", "您好，情况有变：我们的门将在体检中查出瞬目反射过于健康，医生建议他改打后卫。另外市场部总监主动请缨守门——他说他常年替整个部门背锅，经验丰富。委托撤销，感谢。", "Hello — situation update: our keeper's medical found his blink reflex is far too healthy, so the doctor recommends he move to defence. Meanwhile the marketing director has volunteered for goal — he says he's spent years taking the blame for his entire department, so he's highly experienced. Request withdrawn, with thanks.",
                    Slot("slot.w11.office.goalkeeper", PlayerPosition.Goalkeeper, 45, 50, 50)),
                Demand("demand.w12.leader", "club.fogharbor",
                    "雾港", "Fogharbour FC", "上赛季联赛第 9 名，保持着丢球后全队沉默时长的联赛纪录。", "9th in the league last season; holders of the league record for longest total squad silence after conceding.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 3 名；据说那年更衣室里有位会骂人的老队长，可惜他已退役去养海鸥了。", "Best ever: 3rd in the league; rumour says the dressing room had an old captain who knew how to swear back then. Sadly he's retired to raise seagulls.", "主场常年大雾，能见度低到客队经常找不到球门——我们依然丢球。更衣室安静得像图书馆，教练希望有人能制造点噪音。", "The home ground sits in permanent fog, with visibility so low away teams often can't find the goal — we still concede. The dressing room is library-quiet; the coach wants someone to make some noise.",
                    "需要一个后防领袖", "We need a defensive leader",
                    "我们后卫丢球以后没人说话，大家就站在那里看。\n想找个嗓门大的，至少丢球以后能骂两句。", "When our defenders concede, nobody says anything — they just stand there watching.\nWe want someone with a big voice who can at least swear a bit after a goal goes in.",
                    12, 3, 1600,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "后防领袖招募取消", "Defensive-leader recruitment cancelled", "先生，不必麻烦了。昨晚队内会议，替补门将终于开口骂了十五分钟，据说内容震撼人心、词汇丰富，队友纷纷表示被打醒了。教练决定让他改踢中卫。委托撤销，感谢您的倾听。", "Sir, no need to trouble yourself. At last night's team meeting the backup keeper finally opened his mouth and swore for fifteen straight minutes — reportedly soul-stirring stuff with an impressive vocabulary, and the lads all say they feel wide awake now. The coach is moving him to centre-back. Request withdrawn; thank you for listening.",
                    Slot("slot.w12.leader.defender", PlayerPosition.Defender, 70, 60, 80)),
                Demand("demand.w12.utility", "club.archipelago",
                    "群岛联", "Archipelago United", "上赛季群岛联赛第 5 名，全联盟注册球员人数最少纪录保持者。", "5th in the Islands League last season; record holders for the smallest registered squad in the league.",
                    "历史最佳：岛际杯冠军；那届另外两座岛因为台风没来参赛。", "Best ever: Inter-Island Cup winners — the other two islands didn't show up that year because of a typhoon.", "球队分布在三个岛上，客场要坐船，晕船率直接影响首发名单。阵容单薄到队医都要客串边后卫——他踢得还不错。", "The squad is spread across three islands; away trips are by boat, and the seasickness rate directly shapes the starting XI. The squad is so thin the club doctor has to fill in at full-back — he's actually decent.",
                    "我们缺人太严重了", "We are desperately short of players",
                    "最好能踢前锋、边锋、中场，甚至必要时踢后卫。\n简单来说，就是一个人顶三个人。", "Ideally he can play up front, on the wing, in midfield — even at the back if needed.\nIn short, one man does the job of three.",
                    12, 2, 900,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "全能球员需求暂停", "Utility-player requirement paused", "您好，委托撤销。昨天青训营来了三胞胎兄弟，三个人加起来能踢九个位置，还只需要三份盒饭。经理当场拍板签约。抱歉让您白忙，欢迎您冬天来岛上看球，船票自理。", "Hello — request withdrawn. Yesterday a set of triplets turned up at the academy: between the three of them they cover nine positions and only need three lunch boxes. The manager signed them on the spot. Sorry for the wasted effort; you're welcome to come watch a match on the islands in winter — ferry tickets at your own expense.",
                    Slot("slot.w12.utility.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 45, 60, 55)),
                Demand("demand.w13.dirty", "club.castiron",
                    "铸铁竞技", "Cast Iron Athletic", "上赛季联赛第 8 名，犯规总数联盟前三，净胜球为负但对手瘀青数为正。", "8th in the league last season; top three for total fouls. Goal difference: negative. Opponent bruise count: positive.",
                    "历史最佳：杯赛八强；那年的比赛录像被对手当作伤情鉴定证据保存至今。", "Best ever: cup quarter-finalists; opponents from that run still keep the match footage as evidence for their injury assessments.", "主场草皮质量联盟倒数第一，球到这里会主动减速。球迷认为漂亮的传球是懦夫行为，铲球声才是最动听的助威歌。", "The pitch is officially the worst in the league — the ball slows down out of respect. The fans consider a pretty pass an act of cowardice; the sound of a tackle is their favourite chant.",
                    "需要一个干脏活的", "We need someone for the dirty work",
                    "我们的比赛经常变成肉搏战。\n希望找个不介意铲球、争顶和踢得难看一点的后卫。", "Our matches often turn into brawls.\nWe'd like a defender who doesn't mind tackling, heading, and winning ugly.",
                    13, 2, 1000,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "恶汉引进计划取消", "Hard-man signing plan cancelled", "先生您好，情况变化：上赛季跟我们踢得最凶的那支球队解散了，他们的队长自由身加盟——最了解我们打法的人，就是挨过我们打的人。委托关闭。另附创可贴一包，不成敬意。", "Dear Sir, situation update: the team that kicked us hardest last season has folded, and their captain has joined us on a free — nobody understands our style like a man who's been on the receiving end of it. Request closed. Please find a pack of plasters enclosed, as a small token.",
                    Slot("slot.w13.dirty.defender", PlayerPosition.Defender, 58, 72, 60)),
                Demand("demand.w13.stamina", "club.twohalfs",
                    "双半场联", "Two Halves United", "上赛季联赛第 7 名，上半场积分榜第 2，下半场积分榜倒数第 2。", "7th in the league last season: 2nd in the first-half table, second from bottom in the second-half table.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 5 名；那年所有主场比赛都在中午开球，据说球员的午睡习惯帮了大忙。", "Best ever: 5th in the league — the year every home game kicked off at noon, and the players' napping habits are said to have helped enormously.", "更衣室贴着标语：足球比赛有两个半场——这是主教练用惨痛学费学会的。体能教练上月辞职，理由是无法解释的现象。", "A slogan in the dressing room reads: a football match has two halves — a lesson the head coach paid painful tuition to learn. The fitness coach quit last month, citing an unexplained phenomenon.",
                    "体能问题", "A fitness issue",
                    "我们的前锋上半场踢得像世界级球员，下半场基本消失。\n所以这次只要求一件事：90分钟都能看见他。", "Our striker plays like a world-beater in the first half, then basically disappears.\nSo this time we ask only one thing: that we can still see him after 90 minutes.",
                    13, 2, 1400,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "前锋体能引援取消", "Striker stamina signing cancelled", "球探先生：经队医团队研究，前锋下半场消失的原因找到了——午餐吃太饱。俱乐部已更换食堂供应商，下周起改吃三明治。引援委托取消，感谢您的时间，也感谢食堂阿姨的配合。", "Dear Scout: after a thorough study, the medical team has found why our strikers vanish after half-time — lunch was too big. The club has changed canteen supplier; sandwiches from next week. The recruitment request is cancelled. Thanks for your time, and thanks to the dinner ladies for their cooperation.",
                    Slot("slot.w13.stamina.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 62, 85, 60)),
                Demand("demand.w14.scorer", "club.datalight",
                    "数光联", "Datalight United", "上赛季联赛第 10 名，预期进球与实际进球的差值被统计部门列为情绪敏感数据，不对外公开。", "10th in the league last season; the gap between expected goals and actual goals has been classified by the analytics department as emotionally sensitive data. Not for public release.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 6 名；那年的射手王后来被挖走，俱乐部至今保留着印好他名字的球衣库存。", "Best ever: 6th in the league; that season's top scorer was poached, and the club still holds a stock of shirts with his name already printed.", "董事会热爱报表，会议室里的柱状图比奖杯多。他们相信足球的本质是一道填空题：把球放进（　）。", "The board loves a spreadsheet; the meeting room has more bar charts than trophies. They believe football is essentially a fill-in-the-blank question: put the ball in the ( ).",
                    "我们需要一个“进过球的人”", "We need \"someone who has scored goals\"",
                    "不用解释太多战术。\n只要以前某个赛季进球很多，把履历发过来就行。", "No need to explain tactics at length.\nAs long as he scored plenty in some past season, just send over the CV.",
                    14, 2, 1300,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "射手招聘需求已关闭", "Striker vacancy closed", "您好：董事长在旧货市场淘到一台传真机，从里面翻出一份 2003 年的射手榜，认为上面这些人随便来一个就行。经全组劝说，他改为先看青训营——有个孩子上周进了四个。委托取消。", "Hello: the chairman picked up the fax machine at a car-boot sale, pulled out a 2003 top-scorers chart, and declared any one of those lads would do. After a group intervention he agreed to look at the academy instead — one kid scored four last week. Request cancelled.",
                    Slot("slot.w14.scorer.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 70, 55, 60)),
                Demand("demand.w15.targetman", "club.lighthouse.works",
                    "灯塔重工", "Lighthouse Works FC", "上赛季联赛第 12 名，长传次数联盟第一，短传次数联盟倒数第一。", "12th in the league last season: first for long balls, dead last for short passes.",
                    "历史最佳：升级附加赛决赛失利；赛后全队获评最让对手脖子疼的球队。", "Best ever: losing play-off finalists; afterwards the squad was voted the team most likely to give opponents a stiff neck.", "战术手册只有一页：往天上踢，让人去抢。球场边的起重机比角旗更醒目，球迷看球时都戴着安全帽。", "The tactical manual is one page: launch it skywards, let the lads fight for it. The crane beside the pitch is more visible than the corner flags; fans wear hard hats to matches.",
                    "需要一个能扛人的中锋", "We need a centre-forward who can take a hit",
                    "我们踢的是非常直接的足球。\n最好找个身体强一点的，长传来了先别摔。", "We play very direct football.\nIdeally someone with a stronger body — when the long ball comes in, don't fall over first.",
                    15, 2, 1500,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "中锋引进计划搁置", "Target-man signing on hold", "先生，麻烦取消委托。我们现有的中锋上周头球破门后自己也晕了半天——队医说这证明球传得够高、人也够硬，凑合能用。主席表示同意。感谢您的奔走，工地上随时欢迎您来搬砖。", "Sir, please cancel the request. Our current target man scored a header last week and was then dizzy for half a day — the club doctor says this proves the cross was high enough and the man hard enough. He'll do. The chairman concurs. Thanks for your efforts; you're welcome to shift bricks on the site any time.",
                    Slot("slot.w15.targetman.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 65, 80, 65)),
                Demand("demand.w16.academy", "club.futurestar",
                    "未来星", "Future Stars FC", "上赛季联赛第 8 名，一线队平均年龄 21 岁，是联盟唯一赛后集体写作业的球队。", "8th in the league last season; average first-team age 21, and the only club in the league where the whole squad does its homework after matches.",
                    "历史最佳：青年联赛冠军；奖杯放在校长办公室，因为俱乐部办公室要用来开家长会。", "Best ever: youth league champions; the trophy lives in the headmaster's office, because the club office is needed for parents' evenings.", "以青训闻名，卖出去的球员比留下的多。球探部比一线队部人还多，季票卖得最好的是各队球探席。", "Famous for the academy — more players sold than kept. The scouting department outnumbers the first-team staff, and the best-selling season tickets are the ones in the visiting scouts' seats.",
                    "寻找拥有潜力的年轻人", "Seeking a youngster with potential",
