                    16, 4, 1700,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "年轻中场引进取消", "Young-midfielder signing cancelled", "您好，委托关闭。昨天 U16 梯队有个孩子在中圈吊射进了，视频在教练群里转了三十多次。技术总监看完只说了一句：还买什么，这就是我们要培养的。感谢您的关注，三年后他升一队时欢迎再来。", "Hello — request closed. Yesterday an U16 kid scored a lob from the centre circle; the video did the rounds of the coaches' group chat about thirty times. The technical director watched it and said only: why buy anyone — this is exactly what we develop. Thanks for your interest; come back in three years when he's in the first team.",
                    Slot("slot.w16.academy.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 60, 65, 70)),
                Demand("demand.w17.headline", "club.trending",
                    "头条城", "Trending City FC", "上赛季联赛第 13 名，但社交媒体粉丝数联盟前五，输球集锦的播放量最高。", "13th in the league last season, but top five for social-media followers — our defeat compilations get the most views.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 9 名；那一周我们上了三次热搜，其中两次跟足球有关。", "Best ever: 9th in the league; we trended three times that week, two of them football-related.", "市场部话语权大于教练组，签约评估表里话题度一栏排在射术前面。主场上座率一般，直播间人气火爆。", "Marketing outranks the coaching staff; on the signing assessment form, \"buzz\" sits above \"finishing\". Home attendance is average; the livestream numbers are on fire.",
                    "我们想上新闻", "We want to make the news",
                    "能力其实不是最重要的。网上有点名气，就非常合适。", "Ability isn't actually the priority. A bit of online fame makes him perfect for us.",
                    17, 2, 2200,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "流量前锋计划变更", "Influencer-striker plan changed", "您好，计划有变：我们本周签约了一位千万粉丝的宠物博主——他家的狗会颠球。市场部认为人不如狗有话题。原委托取消。为表歉意，俱乐部官方账号已关注您，请记得回关。", "Hello, the plan has changed: this week we signed a pet influencer with ten million followers — his dog can do keepy-uppies. Marketing concluded dogs trend better than people. The original request is cancelled. By way of apology, the club's official account has followed you. Please follow back.",
                    Slot("slot.w17.headline.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 30, 40, 30)),
                Demand("demand.w18.clean", "club.holygrail.academy",
                    "圣杯学院", "Holy Grail Academy", "上赛季联赛第 6 名，纪律分联盟第一——全年无人迟到，无人染发，无人上八卦版。", "6th in the league last season, and first for discipline — all year, nobody was late, nobody dyed their hair, nobody made the gossip pages.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛亚军；颁奖典礼上全队八点半准时离场，因为要熄灯。", "Best ever: league runners-up; at the awards ceremony the whole squad left promptly at 8:30, because it was lights-out.", "半军事化青训营，宿舍十点熄灯，手机每周统一检查。培养出的球员以乖著称，球探报告里最常见的评语是家长放心。", "A semi-military academy: lights out at ten, phones inspected weekly. Its graduates are famous for being well-behaved; the most common line in their scout reports is \"parents can relax\".",
                    "寻找值得培养的球员", "Seeking a player worth developing",
                    "俱乐部希望引进一名年轻球员进行长期培养，但要求私生活检点。", "The club hopes to bring in a young player for long-term development — but requires a spotless private life.",
                    18, 3, 1900,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "年轻人才引进暂停", "Young-talent recruitment paused", "您好，委托暂缓。上周我们面试了一名候选人，天赋极佳，但他手机里有夜店照片——纪律委员会为此开了三个小时会，最终决定先从校内再找一轮。感谢理解。顺带一提，本校熄灯规定同样适用于来访客人。", "Hello — request paused. Last week we interviewed a candidate with superb talent, but his phone contained nightclub photos — the discipline committee held a three-hour meeting and ultimately decided to search the campus once more first. Thank you for understanding. Incidentally, our lights-out rule also applies to visiting guests.",
                    Slot("slot.w18.clean.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 70, 65, 80)),
                Demand("demand.w19.budget", "club.budget.united",
                    "预算联", "Budget United", "上赛季联赛第 14 名，以转会净支出为负还能保级的壮举被财经版报道。", "14th in the league last season; survived with negative net transfer spend, a feat covered in the financial pages.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 10 名；那年全靠免签和租借，被球迷称为白嫖奇迹。", "Best ever: 10th in the league — achieved entirely on free transfers and loans, hailed by the fans as the Freebie Miracle.", "俱乐部座右铭：每一分钱都要进球。办公室灯泡坏了三个月没人换，因为预算里那一栏叫非必要照明。", "Club motto: every penny must score. The office lightbulb has been dead for three months because the budget line reads \"non-essential lighting\".",
                    "低成本高产射手", "A low-cost, high-output striker",
                    "预算有限，因此不会追求高身价球员。\n重点寻找合同即将到期、自由身或在低级别联赛保持稳定进球效率的前锋。", "Budget is limited, so no big price tags.\nThe focus is on forwards whose contracts are running down, free agents, or steady scorers in the lower leagues.",
                    19, 3, 1200,
                    "提交后 2-3 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 2-3 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "射手招募因故取消", "Striker recruitment cancelled for cause", "球探先生，抱歉。财务总监看到候选人的工资要求后，当场把咖啡喷在了报表上。董事会紧急决定：本赛季改用定位球加祈祷方案，成本为零。委托撤销。若您那边有免费试用的球员，欢迎再谈。", "Dear Scout, apologies. When the finance director saw the candidate's wage demands, he spat his coffee straight onto the spreadsheet. The board made an emergency decision: this season we switch to a set-pieces-plus-prayer strategy — zero cost. Request withdrawn. If you have any players on a free trial, do get back in touch.",
                    Slot("slot.w19.budget.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 72, 55, 60)),
                Demand("demand.w21.backup", "club.throne",
                    "王座城", "Throne City FC", "上赛季联赛第 4 名，目前参加洲际冠军联赛资格赛，主力门将保持全勤。", "4th in the league last season; currently in Continental Champions League qualifying, with the first-choice keeper ever-present.",
                    "历史最佳：杯赛冠军；门将决赛扑出三个点球，从此没人敢跟他争首发，也没人敢当他的替补。", "Best ever: cup winners; the keeper saved three penalties in the final, and since then nobody has dared challenge him for the shirt — or dared be his understudy.", "阵容齐整、目标远大，唯一隐患是门将位置：主力很强，替补是青年队小孩。主席每晚梦见的都是同一件事——主力门将感冒。", "A complete squad with big ambitions and one soft spot: goalkeeper. The starter is superb; the backup is a youth-team kid. The chairman has the same dream every night — the first-choice keeper catches a cold.",
                    "高水平替补门将", "High-level backup goalkeeper",
                    "主力门将状态稳定，但球队希望增加门将位置的竞争。\n希望寻找一名经验丰富、能够随时进入首发的替补门将。", "Our first-choice keeper is in stable form, but the club wants real competition for the gloves.\nWe're after an experienced backup who can step into the starting XI at any moment.",
                    21, 2, 2800,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "替补门将需求已解决", "Backup-keeper requirement resolved", "您好，委托取消。青年队小孩上周热身赛扑出一个点球，全队欢呼了五分钟，主席当场宣布我们的未来就在这里。技术总监私下嘟囔那球是冲着立柱去的，但没人理他。感谢关注。", "Hello — request cancelled. The youth kid saved a penalty in last week's friendly, the whole squad cheered for five minutes, and the chairman declared on the spot that our future is here. The technical director muttered privately that the shot was heading for the post, but nobody listened. Thanks for your attention.",
                    Slot("slot.w21.backup.goalkeeper", PlayerPosition.Goalkeeper, 85, 75, 80)),
                Demand("demand.w23.dressing", "club.dawn.youth",
                    "晨曦青年", "Dawn Youth FC", "上赛季联赛第 10 名，一线队平均年龄全联盟最小，赛后采访常有人把先生两个字叫成哥哥。", "10th in the league last season with the youngest first team in the league; in post-match interviews the lads keep calling the interviewer \"big bro\" instead of \"sir\".",
                    "历史最佳：青年杯双冠；奖杯陈列柜由队员轮流擦灰，因为没人够资历独享这项荣誉。", "Best ever: Youth Cup double winners; the players take turns dusting the trophy cabinet, because nobody is senior enough to claim the honour alone.", "青年军当家，冲劲有余、经验欠费。输球后的更衣室安静得可怕——不是愤怒，是没人知道该说什么。", "A team run by kids: plenty of hunger, experience subscription expired. The dressing room after a defeat is terrifyingly quiet — not from anger, but because nobody knows what to say.",
                    "更衣室领袖", "A dressing-room leader",
                    "球队年轻球员较多，希望加入一名有丰富职业经历的老将。\n除了竞技能力外，更看重领导力和更衣室影响力。", "The squad is very young, so we'd like to add a veteran with a long pro career.\nBeyond playing ability, what matters most is leadership and dressing-room presence.",
                    23, 3, 1800,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "老将引进计划取消", "Veteran signing plan cancelled", "先生您好，计划取消。梯队教练主动申请复出：我 42 了，资历够老，正好镇场子。首场训练他跑了二十分钟就扶腰，但讲话确实有人听了。委托撤销，感谢您的时间。", "Dear Sir, plan cancelled. The youth-team coach has volunteered to come out of retirement: \"I'm 42, senior enough — perfect for keeping the room in line.\" In his first session he clutched his back after twenty minutes, but people genuinely listen when he talks. Request withdrawn; thank you for your time.",
                    Slot("slot.w23.dressing.defender", PlayerPosition.Defender, 68, 50, 82)),
                Demand("demand.w24.flank", "club.flankguard",
                    "翼卫联", "Flankguard United", "上赛季联赛第 9 名，边路被过次数联盟第二多——第一是已经降级的走廊体育。", "9th in the league last season; second-most dribbled-past on the flanks — first place went to Corridor Athletic, who got relegated.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 5 名；那一年对手的边锋赛后集体接受了心理辅导。", "Best ever: 5th in the league; that season, opposing wingers collectively sought counselling after playing us.", "主教练是边后卫出身，办公室挂着名言：中路丢球是事故，边路丢球是犯罪。球探部门上周提交了四十份报告，全是边后卫。", "The manager is a former full-back; a motto hangs in his office: \"Concede through the middle and it's an accident. Concede down the flank and it's a crime.\" The scouting department filed forty reports last week — every one a full-back.",
                    "增强边路防守", "Strengthen the wide defence",
