                    24, 2, 1600,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "边路补强需求撤销", "Wide-defence reinforcement withdrawn", "您好，不必再找了。上周末对手边锋全场零过人——不是我们防守变好了，而是他赛前吃坏了肚子。教练认为这证明体系已经成立，引援暂停。感谢奔走，祝您胃口好。", "Hello — no need to keep looking. Last weekend their winger completed zero dribbles all match — not because our defence improved, but because he'd eaten something dodgy before the game. The coach takes this as proof the system works; recruitment paused. Thanks for running around, and bon appétit.",
