                    "历史最佳：联赛第 8 名；董事长把那年的全队合照放大挂在大厅，照片里他站在最中间。", "Best ever: 8th in the league; the chairman had that year's squad photo enlarged and hung in the lobby. He is standing in the very middle.", "赞助商名单很短：董事长自己的三家公司。训练基地的标语是快乐足球——主要是董事长一个人的快乐。", "The sponsor list is short: the chairman's own three companies. The training-ground slogan is Happy Football — chiefly the chairman's happiness.",
