                    25, 4, 2000,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "中场引进计划暂停", "Midfielder signing plan paused", "球探先生，遗憾地通知您：董事长上周队内赛送出一次助攻，心情大好，宣布现有中场已完全够用。技术总监试图解释那是梯队小孩让的，被请去喝了茶。委托暂缓，祝您工作顺利。", "Dear Scout, we regret to inform you: the chairman registered an assist in last week's in-house match, was delighted, and declared the current midfield entirely sufficient. The technical director attempted to explain that the academy kid let him have it, and was invited for a cup of tea. Request paused; wishing you smooth work.",
                    Slot("slot.w25.chairman.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 75, 60, 70)),
                Demand("demand.w26.goldpan", "club.goldpanners",
                    "淘金者", "Goldpanners FC", "上赛季联赛第 13 名，但卖人收入联盟前三，被业内称为足坛二手市场。", "13th in the league last season, but top three for income from player sales — known in the trade as football's second-hand market.",
                    "历史最佳：杯赛四强；主力阵容里有四个豪门弃将，赛后对方主席拒绝对此发表评论。", "Best ever: cup semi-finalists with four big-club rejects in the starting XI; the other chairman declined to comment after the match.", "经营哲学：别人扔掉的，我们擦亮再卖。更衣室储物柜都是二手的——据说有一个曾属于某位巨星，俱乐部打算等升值。", "Business philosophy: what others throw away, we polish and resell. Even the dressing-room lockers are second-hand — one supposedly belonged to a superstar, and the club is holding it until it appreciates.",
                    "低价淘金", "Bargain-bin gold panning",
                    "我们相信被大俱乐部放弃的球员里还有很多好东西。\n如果年龄不大，可以认真谈。", "We believe there are still plenty of gems among the players the big clubs gave up on.\nIf he's not too old, we can talk seriously.",
                    26, 3, 1100,
                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "淘金计划本期收工", "This round of gold-panning is done", "先生，委托关闭。上周我们免签了一名被豪门放弃的小孩，首场就进球了。经理兴奋之余把引援预算改成了他的续约奖金。本期淘金结束，欢迎下次再来——最好赶在我们把他卖掉之前。", "Sir — request closed. Last week we signed a kid a big club had given up on, free of charge, and he scored on his debut. In his excitement the manager converted the transfer budget into the lad's renewal bonus. This panning season is over; come again next time — ideally before we sell him.",
                    Slot("slot.w26.goldpan.forward", PlayerPosition.Forward, 60, 60, 55)),
                Demand("demand.w27.physical", "club.collision.city",
