                    "历史最佳：联赛第 9 名；那个赛季有六支球队申请把与我们的比赛改期，理由是场地积水。", "Best ever: 9th in the league — the season when six clubs applied to reschedule matches against us, citing a waterlogged pitch.", "训练基地的健身房比战术室大三倍。票务广告词是来看一场真正的身体足球，配图是一副担架。", "At the training ground, the gym is three times the size of the tactics room. The ticket ad reads \"come watch some real physical football\" — illustrated with a stretcher.",
                    "提升竞争力", "Raise our competitiveness",
