                    "提交后 1 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 1 week of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "硬汉招募计划取消", "Hard-man recruitment cancelled", "您好，招募取消。昨天队内对抗赛，我们队长和副队长撞在一起双双倒地，队医称内部消耗已达上限。教练决定改练技术流。委托撤销。两位队长目前恢复良好，已能自主进食。", "Hello — recruitment cancelled. In yesterday's practice match, our captain and vice-captain collided with each other and both went down; the club doctor says internal attrition has reached its limit. The coach has decided to work on technical football instead. Request withdrawn. Both captains are recovering well and can already feed themselves.",
