                    "历史最佳：联赛第 7 名；那是队史唯一全员健康的赛季，被载入年鉴，标题是奇迹年。", "Best ever: 7th in the league — the only fully-fit season in club history, entered in the yearbook under the heading \"The Miracle Year\".", "体检设备比训练设备先进，签约流程里体检要过三关。俱乐部餐厅禁止油炸食品，甜品需要队医签字批准。", "The medical equipment is more advanced than the training equipment; the signing process includes three stages of medicals. The canteen bans fried food, and desserts require the club doctor's signature.",
