                    28, 3, 1700,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "铁人引进需求关闭", "Iron-man signing requirement closed", "球探先生，告诉您一个好消息：本周全员体检，十一人全部通过——队史首次。主席激动得哭了，当场宣布天不亡我，引援暂停。另外队医提议把本周定为俱乐部健康纪念日，正在走流程。", "Dear Scout, wonderful news: at this week's full-squad medical, all eleven passed — a club first. The chairman burst into tears and declared on the spot that heaven has not forsaken us; recruitment is paused. The club doctor has also proposed designating this week as Club Health Memorial Day. Paperwork is in progress.",
                    Slot("slot.w28.noill.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 58, 85, 70)),
                Demand("demand.w30.biggame", "club.knockout.experts",
                    "淘汰赛联", "Knockout Experts FC", "上赛季联赛第 5 名、杯赛四强——联赛靠实力，淘汰赛靠的全是经验。", "5th in the league last season and cup semi-finalists — the league runs on quality; the knockouts run purely on experience.",
                    "历史最佳：洲际赛事八强；首回合落后三球次回合逆转，那场球被剪成每年新援的入职培训片。", "Best ever: continental quarter-finalists; three goals down after the first leg, we turned it round in the second. That match is cut into the induction video every new signing must watch.", "阵容不差，缺的是见过大场面的人。关键战役前，更衣室墙上会投影对手球场照片，据说是为了提前适应紧张。", "The squad is decent; what's missing is someone who's seen the big occasion. Before crunch ties, photos of the opponent's stadium are projected on the dressing-room wall — supposedly to acclimatise everyone to being nervous.",
                    "关键比赛经验", "Big-match experience",
                    "联赛数据不是最重要的。\n如果球员参加过欧冠、欧联或者欧协联，并且有关键比赛进球，会非常有吸引力", "League numbers aren't the priority.\nA player who has featured in the Champions League, Europa League or Conference League — and scored in big games — would be very attractive.",
                    30, 3, 3000,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "大场面先生招募取消", "Mr Big-Game recruitment cancelled", "先生您好，招募取消。我们的老队长看完半决赛录像后宣布再踢一年：这帮孩子在点球点前腿软的样子，我实在看不下去。虽然他上赛季场均跑动只有八千米，但气场八千米都不止。感谢关注。", "Dear Sir, recruitment cancelled. Our old captain watched the semi-final tape and announced he'd play one more year: \"I can't bear watching these kids' legs turn to jelly at the penalty spot.\" He only averaged eight kilometres a match last season, but his aura covers far more than eight kilometres. Thanks for your attention.",
                    Slot("slot.w30.biggame.midfielder", PlayerPosition.Midfielder, 78, 60, 75)),
                Demand("demand.w33.counter", "club.counterstorm",
                    "反击风暴", "Counterstorm FC", "上赛季联赛第 6 名，场均控球率倒数第三，反击进球数正数第三。", "6th in the league last season: third-lowest average possession, third-highest counter-attack goals.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛季军；整季场均控球 38%，主教练把那年的战术板捐给了博物馆，标题是少即是多。", "Best ever: third in the league with 38% average possession all season; the manager donated that year's tactics board to a museum, titled \"Less Is More\".", "全队速度至上，训练第一课是三秒内完成由守转攻。门将手抛球时速有专人统计，后卫的第一脚长传被当作进攻发起点评分。", "Speed above all; the first lesson of training is defence to attack in three seconds. The keeper's throw-out speed is officially tracked, and a defender's first long ball is graded as a point of attack.",
                    "转换进攻", "Transition attack",
                    "球队希望加强由守转攻。\n如果能够从后场直接找到前锋，会非常符合要求。", "The team wants to sharpen its transition from defence to attack.\nA player who can find the striker directly from the back would fit perfectly.",
                    33, 2, 2100,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "反击发起点引援终止", "Counter-attack-launcher signing terminated", "您好，委托取消。上周热身赛，我们的中卫一脚六十米长传直接助攻，教练组反复看了二十遍录像，决定此人就是答案。虽然他其余八十九分钟表现平平，但体系球员就是这么定义的。感谢奔走。", "Hello — request cancelled. In last week's friendly, our centre-back assisted directly with a 60-metre long ball; the coaching staff watched the tape twenty times and decided he is the answer. He was ordinary for the other 89 minutes, but that's precisely how a system player is defined. Thanks for your efforts.",
                    Slot("slot.w33.counter.defender", PlayerPosition.Defender, 72, 65, 68)),
                Demand("demand.w36.blindside", "club.blindside.blade",
                    "盲刃联", "Blindside Blades FC", "上赛季联赛第 8 名，看不见的地方进球占全队一半——另一半是定位球。", "8th in the league last season; half our goals came from unseen places — the other half from set pieces.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 6 名；那年十佳球集锦里，有六个进球连解说员都没看清是谁进的。", "Best ever: 6th in the league; in that season's top-ten goals reel, even the commentator couldn't tell who scored six of them.", "主教练痴迷无球跑动，训练课上得最多的是如何从后卫背后长出来。队内流传一句话：持球是责任，无球是艺术。", "The manager is obsessed with off-ball movement; the most-taught lesson in training is how to grow out of a defender's back. A saying circulates in the squad: on the ball is duty, off the ball is art.",
                    "无球跑动", "Off-ball movement",
                    "我们希望新边锋能够频繁从盲侧插入禁区。\n他甚至不需要大量持球，只要会跑就行。", "We want the new winger to keep arriving in the box from the blind side.\nHe doesn't even need many touches — as long as he can run.",
                    36, 3, 2300,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "盲侧边锋需求关闭", "Blindside winger requirement closed", "先生，不必麻烦了。上周青年队比赛，一名小孩从盲区插上进了两个——第二个连现场摄影师都没跟上。主教练看完沉默良久，说：就是他了。委托撤销。那孩子现正接受如何被镜头捕捉的培训。", "Sir — no further trouble needed. In last week's youth match, a kid arrived from the blind side to score two; even the on-site cameraman missed the second. The manager watched in long silence, then said: \"He's the one.\" Request withdrawn. The lad is currently in training on how to be captured on camera.",
                    Slot("slot.w36.blindside.winger", PlayerPosition.Winger, 74, 70, 65)),
                Demand("demand.w39.thin", "club.austerity.athletic",
                    "紧缩竞技", "Austerity Athletic", "上赛季联赛第 15 名，以 19 人阵容撑完全季，替补席常年比看台还空。", "15th in the league last season, surviving the whole campaign with a 19-man squad; the bench is permanently emptier than the stands.",
                    "历史最佳：联赛第 9 名；那年全队共用三双护腿板，获评最具可持续性俱乐部。", "Best ever: 9th in the league — the season the whole squad shared three pairs of shin pads, earning the club the title of Most Sustainable Club.", "财政困难，预算表精确到胶带卷数。俱乐部口号是一个顶三——不只是战术理念，更是财务政策。", "Financial difficulties; the budget is itemised down to rolls of tape. The club slogan is \"one man does the job of three\" — not just a tactical philosophy, but a financial policy.",
                    "节省阵容名额", "Saving squad slots",
                    "财政困难俱乐部希望减少阵容人数。\n如果一个球员能够胜任三个位置，我们会给予明显优先级。", "A financially troubled club hopes to shrink the squad.\nIf one player can cover three positions, he gets clear priority.",
                    39, 4, 1900,
                    "提交后 4 周反馈，成功安排后付款。", "Feedback within 4 weeks of submission; payment on successful placement.",
                    "全能战士招募暂停", "All-round-warrior recruitment paused", "球探先生，委托暂缓。财务部门算出引进一人的差旅体检费够发全队两周伙食，主席沉吟许久，决定先让现有球员再多兼一个位置试试。边锋已开始加练守门，据说手套是借的。感谢理解。", "Dear Scout, request paused. Finance calculated that one signing's travel and medical costs would cover two weeks of food for the whole squad; the chairman pondered long and hard, and decided to first try having current players cover one more position each. The winger has begun extra goalkeeping practice — the gloves are reportedly borrowed. Thank you for understanding.",
