                    "荷甲过人王，速度毋庸置疑，传中另议。", "Eredivisie dribbling king. Pace beyond doubt; crossing negotiable.", "现推荐边锋 Kyle Mendes：荷甲过人王，启动速度令整条边路闻风丧胆，反击中拿球约等于直接快进。球探报告提到传中与终结仍需打磨，我方理解为“升值空间充足”。可随时安排试训，请自备秒表。", "Presenting winger Kyle Mendes: Eredivisie dribbling king, with take-off speed that terrifies entire flanks; on the counter, him receiving the ball is effectively a fast-forward button. The scout report notes crossing and finishing need polish — we read that as “generous headroom for appreciation”. Trial available anytime; bring your own stopwatch.",
