                    "十八年低级别老兵，没有高光，只有卡位。", "Eighteen-year lower-league veteran. No highlights, just positioning.", "您好，我是 Antonio Ferreira，自己写邮件，省一笔中介费。十八年低级别联赛履历，没有豪门，但每任教练走之前都想带我走。位置感和经验随信附上，速度部分请勿追问。工资好商量，更衣柜靠门就行。", "Hello, Antonio Ferreira here, writing my own email to save an agent's fee. Eighteen years in the lower leagues — no glamour clubs, but every manager tried to take me with him when he left. Positioning and experience enclosed; please don't ask about the pace. Wages negotiable; a locker by the door will do.",
