                    "比甲零封王，擅长让单刀变成单相思。", "Belgian league clean-sheet king; turns one-on-ones into unrequited love.", "委托推荐门将 Victor Mora：近距离扑救反应顶级，单刀球是他的私人恩怨，上赛季零封场次比甲第一。前锋见了他通常先失去信心，再失去球权。转会费面议，零封奖金的写法我们已经有模板了。", "Commissioned to recommend goalkeeper Victor Mora: elite close-range reflexes; one-on-ones are a personal grudge of his, and last season's clean sheets topped the Belgian league. Strikers who meet him generally lose their confidence first, then the ball. Fee negotiable; we already have a template for the clean-sheet bonus clause.",
                    "经纪人材料 · 零封数据可查，可信", "Agent material · clean-sheet data verifiable, credible", playerId: "player.mora.victor"),
                Mail("mail.w8.rosales.diego", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 8,
                    "家族事务办 · 表叔", "Family Affairs Office · the Second Uncle", "球员简历：Diego  Rosales", "Player CV: Diego Rosales",
                    "阿根廷传奇球王远亲自荐，证据在邻居手里。", "Distant relative of an Argentine legend, self-recommended. Evidence held by the neighbours.", "兹有 Diego  Rosales 先生委托投递简历。其足球天赋据信源自家族遗传，青年联赛期间已凭这个故事获得大量关注。邻居可以作证：“球王本人还去他家吃过饭。”血统证书正在补办，在那之前，先踢球也行。", "Mr Diego Rosales has asked us to submit his CV. His footballing talent is believed to be hereditary, a story that earned him considerable attention in youth football. The neighbours can vouch: “The legend himself once came to their house for dinner.” The pedigree certificate is being reissued; until then, he's happy to just play football.",
                    "家属代投 · 故事动听，可信度自辨", "Submitted by family · lovely story, credibility yours to judge", playerId: "player.rosales.diego"),
                Mail("mail.w9.costa.bruno", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 9,
                    "重坦经纪 · 杜邦", "Heavy Tank Agency · Dupont", "球员简历：Bruno Costa", "Player CV: Bruno Costa",
                    "边路坦克一辆，让路者生还率百分之百。", "One flank tank for sale. Survival rate for those who get out of the way: 100%.", "推荐边后卫 Bruno Costa：纯粹的力量型冲击机器，训练赛里他一启动，队友的第一反应不是抢球，是让路。法国边锋群体对他已形成成熟的恐惧体系。对抗与往返能力顶级，技术细节属于“撞开就好”的范畴。", "Recommending wing-back Bruno Costa: a pure power-driven battering ram. When he starts moving in training games, his own teammates' first instinct isn't to win the ball — it's to get out of the way. French wingers have developed a mature, well-organised fear of him. Top-tier duelling and shuttling; the finer technical details fall under “just barge through”.",
                    "经纪人材料 · 前队友证词，大体可信", "Agent material · former teammates' testimony, broadly credible", playerId: "player.costa.bruno"),
                Mail("mail.w9.silva.marco", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 9,
                    "耐力无限经纪 · 佩雷拉", "Endurance Unlimited Agency · Pereira", "球员简历：Marco Silva", "Player CV: Marco Silva",
                    "90分钟后还能冲刺的前锋，加时赛是舒适区。", "A forward still sprinting after 90 minutes; extra time is his comfort zone.", "推荐前锋 Marco Silva：技术是副业，体能是本行。90分钟后依旧高速奔跑，加时赛最后几分钟还能冲刺，对方中卫最怕听到的一句话是“席尔瓦还没下场”。小学长跑出身的底子，耐力这东西他从没续过费。", "Recommending forward Marco Silva: technique is his side hustle, stamina is the day job. Still running at full pelt after 90 minutes, still sprinting in the last minutes of extra time; the sentence opposition centre-backs dread most is “Silva's still on”. A schoolboy distance runner by upbringing — his stamina has never needed a renewal fee.",
                    "经纪人材料 · 体育老师证词，大体可信", "Agent material · PE teacher's testimony, broadly credible", playerId: "player.silva.marco"),
