                    "新派门将经纪 · 德克", "New-School Keepers Agency · Dirk", "球员简历：André Onaku", "Player CV: André Onaku",
                    "用脚踢球的门将，后场组织从他脚下开始。", "A keeper who plays with his feet; the build-up starts with him.", "推荐门将 André Onaku：青训时因反应过快从前锋改造为门将，脚下技术和进攻意识保留至今，常参与后场组织，是体系里的第一出球点。扑救能力业内评价为“够用”——组织型门将，下单前请想清楚。", "Recommending goalkeeper André Onaku: converted from striker to keeper in the academy because his reactions were too quick, and he's kept the footwork and attacking instinct ever since. Regularly joins the build-up as the system's first outlet. His shot-stopping is rated “adequate” by the industry — he's a playmaking keeper, so please be sure before ordering.",
