                Mail("mail.w10.rivas.j", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 10,
                    "里瓦斯团队 · 首席助理", "Team Rivas · Chief of Staff", "球员简历：J. Rivas · 传奇回归", "Player CV: J. Rivas · return of a legend",
                    "左脚还在，身体待考，名气管够。", "The left foot is intact, the body under review, the fame fully stocked.", "受 J. Rivas 先生委托发送简历。前世界级中场，左脚、传球、远射皆属教科书级别，最新训练录像确认技术完好。过去三年鲜少正式比赛，身体状态是唯一疑问。诚寻一支懂得分期使用传奇的球队。", "Sent on behalf of Mr J. Rivas. Former world-class midfielder; the left foot, the passing and the long-range shooting are all textbook, and the latest training footage confirms the technique is intact. He has played little competitive football in three years — fitness is the only question. Seeking a club that understands how to use a legend in instalments.",
                    "球员团队材料 · 录像可查，身体需复检", "Player's team material · footage verifiable, body needs a second look", playerId: "player.rivas.j"),
                Mail("mail.w11.vieira.lucas", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 11,
                    "街头星探 · 卡洛琳", "Street Scout · Caroline", "球员简历：Lucas Vieira", "Player CV: Lucas Vieira",
                    "圣保罗街头走出的天才，过人像呼吸。", "A talent off the streets of São Paulo; he dribbles like he breathes.", "推荐中场 Lucas Vieira：圣保罗贫民区街头足球出身，15岁被球探相中进入青训体系。青年队比赛曾连过三人完成绝杀，录像随时可发。技术和灵气都是顶配，欠缺的只是欧洲赛场的经验——这恰好是贵队能给的部分。", "Recommending midfielder Lucas Vieira: raised on street football in a São Paulo favela, spotted by scouts at 15 and brought into the academy. Once beat three men straight to score a youth-team winner — footage available on request. Technique and flair are top-spec; all he lacks is European experience, which happens to be exactly what your club can supply.",
                    "球探一手材料 · 有青年赛录像佐证", "Scout's first-hand material · backed by youth-match footage", playerId: "player.vieira.lucas"),
                Mail("mail.w11.ferreira.jose", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 11,
                    "老将互助会 · 若昂", "Veterans' Mutual Aid Society · João", "球员简历：José Ferreira", "Player CV: José Ferreira",
                    "八支球队的老队长，没输过更衣室。", "Old captain of eight clubs; never lost a dressing room.", "代 José Ferreira 投递简历：葡萄牙三四级联赛二十余年，效力八支球队，到哪里都是队长。身体和速度已不在巅峰，但强硬与经验属于免检产品。适合需要有人镇住更衣室的球队，工资要求和他本人一样朴实。", "Submitting a CV on behalf of José Ferreira: twenty-odd years in Portugal's third and fourth tiers, eight clubs, captain wherever he went. Body and pace are past their peak, but the steel and experience are exempt from inspection. Ideal for a club that needs someone to hold the dressing room; his wage demands are as unpretentious as he is.",
