                Mail("mail.w12.ortega.carlos", MailContentKind.PlayerResume, 12,
                    "沉睡者经纪 · 桑丘", "Sleepers Agency · Sancho", "球员简历：Carlos Ortega", "Player CV: Carlos Ortega",
                    "禁区里的幽灵，进球时请不要吵醒他。", "The Ghost in the Box. Please don't wake him when he scores.", "推荐前锋 Carlos Ortega：第四级联赛七年老兵，连续两季球队最佳射手，金靴在柜子里。速度方面请放低期待，但只要球进禁区，他比所有人都先醒。适合传中质量尚可、前锋只需跑位的体系。", "Recommending forward Carlos Ortega: a seven-year veteran of the fourth tier, the club's top scorer two seasons running, the Golden Boot in his cabinet. Keep expectations low on pace, but the moment the ball enters the box he's awake before everyone else. Suits a system with decent crossing where the striker only needs to move.",
