                    "闪电经纪 · 罗哈斯", "Lightning Agency · Rojas", "球员简历：Luis Herrera", "Player CV: Luis Herrera",
                    "快是真的，稳不稳看缘分。", "The pace is real; the consistency is fate's call.", "推荐边锋 Luis Herrera：速度是他的母语，九年九队历练，反击时一个人就是一次进攻。前队友的评价很全面：“他能一个人赢下比赛，也可能整场摸不到球。”适合有冒险精神的教练，建议按场次盲盒的心态使用。", "Recommending winger Luis Herrera: speed is his mother tongue, seasoned across nine clubs in nine years — on the counter he is an attack all by himself. A former teammate's verdict covers it: “He can win a match alone, or fail to find the ball for ninety minutes.” Suits adventurous managers; best used with a lucky-dip mentality.",
